---
---

<section
  class="relative w-full h-[1036px] bg-cream overflow-hidden"
  aria-labelledby="flow-heading"
>
  <h2
    id="flow-heading"
    class="absolute top-[50px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-pink text-[28px] font-bold leading-none whitespace-nowrap"
  >
    ご購入の流れ
  </h2>

  <div class="absolute top-[122px] left-[14px] w-[373px] h-[307px] bg-pink rounded-[10px]">
    <div class="absolute top-[28px] left-[19px] w-[336px] h-[68px]">
      <img
        src="/images/flow/cta-banner-bg.svg"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute top-0 left-0 block w-full h-full"
      />
      <div class="absolute top-[19px] left-[118px] flex w-[100px] h-1 gap-3" aria-hidden="true">
        {Array.from({ length: 7 }).map(() => (
          <div class="w-1 h-1 bg-black rounded-sm" />
        ))}
      </div>
      <p
        class="absolute top-[26px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[304px] text-black text-base font-bold text-center leading-none"
      >
        ご購入には「動物病院コード」が必要です
      </p>
    </div>

    <p
      class="absolute top-[113px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[331px] text-white text-sm font-medium text-center leading-[23px]"
    >
      「どうぶつ病院宅配便」は、獣医師の先生の食事指導のもと、適切な食事を継続して食べてもらうためのサービスです。ご購入には、動物病院より渡される「動物病院コード」が必要になります。
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://drs.petline.co.jp/shop/hospitallist.aspx"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="absolute top-[222px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex w-[319px] h-[63px] items-center justify-center gap-[10px] bg-white rounded-[100px] border-2 border-pink shadow-[1.65px_1.65px_2.47px_#00000029] hover:opacity-90"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/shared/icon-external-link.png"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        width="17"
        height="20"
        class="block w-[17px] h-[20px]"
      />
      <span class="text-pink text-[17px] font-bold leading-none">
        取扱動物病院を検索する
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <article
    class="absolute top-[449px] left-[14px] w-[373px] h-[208px] bg-white rounded-[10px] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_#c5385f]"
  >
    <div class="absolute top-[32px] left-[34px] flex items-baseline gap-[10px]">
      <span class="text-pink text-base font-bold leading-none">01.</span>
      <h3 class="text-pink text-xl font-bold leading-none">まずは会員登録</h3>
    </div>

    <div
      class="absolute top-[83px] left-10 flex w-[294px] h-[39px] items-center justify-center px-0 py-2 rounded-[30px] border border-pink"
    >
      <span class="text-pink text-[15px] font-bold leading-none">
        アプリをダウンロード
      </span>
    </div>

    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="absolute top-[122px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-px h-[13px] bg-pink"
    >
    </div>

    <div
      class="absolute top-[135px] left-10 flex w-[294px] h-[39px] items-center justify-center px-0 py-2 rounded-[30px] border border-pink"
    >
      <span class="text-pink text-[15px] font-bold leading-none">
        お客様情報・動物病院コードを入力
      </span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute top-[657px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-0.5 h-[20px] bg-pink"
  >
  </div>

  <article
    class="absolute top-[677px] left-[14px] w-[373px] h-[309px] bg-white rounded-[10px] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_#c5385f]"
  >
    <div class="absolute top-[32px] left-[34px] flex items-baseline gap-[10px]">
      <span class="text-pink text-base font-bold leading-none">02.</span>
      <h3 class="text-pink text-xl font-bold leading-none">商品を選んで注文</h3>
    </div>

    <div
      class="absolute top-[83px] left-10 flex w-[294px] h-[39px] items-center justify-center px-0 py-2 rounded-[30px] border border-pink"
    >
      <span class="text-pink text-[15px] font-bold leading-none">商品を選ぶ</span>
    </div>

    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="absolute top-[122px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-px h-[13px] bg-pink"
    >
    </div>

    <button
      type="button"
      data-copy-code="32588"
      aria-label="キャンペーンコード 32588 をコピー"
      class="absolute top-[135px] left-10 flex w-[294px] h-[68px] items-center justify-center px-0 py-2 bg-pink rounded-[10px] border border-pink cursor-pointer transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#4a90e2]"
    >
      <p class="text-white text-center font-black leading-tight">
        <span class="text-[15px]">注文時にキャンペーンコード<br /></span>
        <span class="text-2xl">【32588】</span>
        <span class="text-[15px]">を入力</span>
      </p>
    </button>

    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="absolute top-[203px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-px h-[13px] bg-pink"
    >
    </div>

    <div
      class="absolute top-[216px] left-10 flex w-[294px] h-[39px] items-center justify-center px-0 py-2 rounded-[30px] border border-pink"
    >
      <span class="text-pink text-[15px] font-bold leading-none">
        確定して注文完了！
      </span>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
